  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tgq23EN.png\" alt=\"YUNG's Better Nether Fortresses\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"需依赖YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入YUNG GANG Discord社群！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"追蹤我的Twitter！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"訂閱我的YouTube頻道！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在Patreon贊助我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/brWx8ey.png\" alt=\"這是什麼？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p><strong>徹底改造Minecraft的地獄要塞！</strong> YUNG's Better Nether Fortresses從底層重新設計了地獄要塞。與原版相比，更好的要塞規模更大、結構更複雜且獎勵更豐富。每座要塞由三個部分組成——橋樑網絡、要塞主堡，以及深入地下延伸的岩漿大廳。<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>YUNG's Better Nether Fortresses還內建了Create模組兼容性！</strong> 若您使用Create模組，要塞某些部位有機率會生成Create風格的結構。請注意此為可選功能——本模組無須安裝Create即可運行。請確保使用對應您Minecraft版本的最新Create模組！注意此功能僅支援1.19.2+版本。</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/omRqM-gZBAg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3wUhXJJ.png\" alt=\"兼容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>YUNG's Better Nether Fortresses設計上完全兼容各類地形生成模組，包括：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-ocean-monuments\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-witch-huts\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Witch Huts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n<li>Infernal Expansion及其他地獄生態域模組</li>\n<li>Apocalyptic Fortress：AF要塞將與本模組要塞並存生成</li>\n<li>Bygone Nether：本模組要塞將取代Bygone Nether的強化版原版要塞</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用優惠碼YUNGNICKYOUNG可享Bisect Hosting 25%折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
